, 20T-80E, 30T-70E, and 40T-60E at 25.0 &#x000b0;C [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b4-ijms-10-00862">4</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b37-ijms-10-00862">37</xref>]. Interpolated values for <italic>N</italic><sub>T</sub> and <italic>Y</italic><sub>Cl</sub>: 0.10 and &#x02212;0.67 for 95% MeOH; 0.27 and &#x02212;1.61 for 95% EtOH; &#x02212;0.33 and &#x02212;1.51 for 85% acetone; and 0.22 and &#x02212;1.97 for 10%TFE-90%EtOH. Also an interpolated <italic>Y</italic><sub>Cl</sub> value of &#x02212;0.93 for 30T-70E.</p></fn><fn id="tfn44-ijms-10-00862"><label><sup>k</sup></label><p>Values taken from [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b5-ijms-10-00862">5</xref>].</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>